{
    "name": "[Human_proxy]:[Skills] (13/13) | Cotizar",
    "flow": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "hook": null,
                "maxResults": 1
            },
            "mapper": {},
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 150
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "module": "builtin:BasicFeeder",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "filter": {
                "name": "Token correcto",
                "conditions": [
                    [
                        {
                            "a": "{{1.token}}",
                            "b": "<TOKEN>",
                            "o": "text:equal"
                        }
                    ]
                ]
            },
            "mapper": {
                "array": "{{slice(split(replace(1.simbolos; \" \"; \"\"); \",\"); 0; 5)}}"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 300,
                    "y": 150
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 3,
            "module": "http:MakeRequest",
            "version": 4,
            "parameters": {
                "tlsType": "",
                "authenticationType": "noAuth"
            },
            "filter": {
                "name": "Símbolo no vacío",
                "conditions": [
                    [
                        {
                            "a": "{{2.value}}",
                            "o": "exist"
                        }
                    ]
                ]
            },
            "mapper": {
                "url": "https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/{{encodeURL(2.value)}}?interval=1d&range=1d",
                "method": "get",
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "name": "User-Agent",
                        "value": "Mozilla/5.0"
                    }
                ],
                "timeout": "30",
                "shareCookies": false,
                "parseResponse": true,
                "allowRedirects": true,
                "stopOnHttpError": false,
                "requestCompressedContent": true
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 600,
                    "y": 150
                }
            },
            "onerror": [
                {
                    "id": 903,
                    "module": "builtin:Ignore",
                    "version": 1,
                    "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                            "x": 900,
                            "y": 300
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": 4,
            "module": "util:TextAggregator",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {
                "feeder": 2,
                "rowSeparator": ","
            },
            "mapper": {
                "value": "{\"simbolo\": \"{{escapeJSON(2.value)}}\", \"nombre\": \"{{escapeJSON(get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.longName\"))}}\", \"precio\": {{ifempty(get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.regularMarketPrice\"); \"null\")}}, \"cierre_anterior\": {{ifempty(get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.chartPreviousClose\"); \"null\")}}, \"moneda\": \"{{get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.currency\")}}\", \"hora\": \"{{if(get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.regularMarketTime\"); formatDate(parseDate(get(3.data.chart.result; \"1.meta.regularMarketTime\"); \"X\"); \"DD/MM/YYYY HH:mm\"; \"Europe/Madrid\"); \"\")}}\", \"error\": \"{{escapeJSON(3.data.chart.error.description)}}\"}"
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 900,
                    "y": 0
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": 5,
            "module": "gateway:WebhookRespond",
            "version": 1,
            "parameters": {},
            "mapper": {
                "body": "{\"precios\": [{{4.text}}]}",
                "status": "200",
                "headers": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                    "x": 1200,
                    "y": 0
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "metadata": {
        "instant": true,
        "version": 1,
        "scenario": {
            "roundtrips": 1,
            "maxErrors": 3,
            "autoCommit": true,
            "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
            "sequential": false,
            "slots": null,
            "confidential": false,
            "dataloss": false,
            "dlq": false,
            "freshVariables": false
        },
        "designer": {
            "orphans": []
        },
        "zone": "eu1.make.com",
        "notes": [
            {
                "moduleIds": [
                    3
                ],
                "content": "<p><strong>Yahoo Finance, endpoint de gráficos</strong></p><p>Sin clave. Símbolos al estilo Yahoo: Madrid con sufijo .MC (ITX.MC), EE. UU. sin sufijo, índices con ^ (^IBEX).</p><p>Es un endpoint no oficial: puede cambiar o bloquearse sin aviso.</p>",
                "isFilterNote": false,
                "metadata": {
                    "color": "#9138FE"
                }
            },
            {
                "moduleIds": [
                    1
                ],
                "content": "<p><strong>Webhook de entrada</strong></p><p>Origen: (6) Responder, cuando el mensaje pregunta por precios o mercado.</p><p>Destino: este escenario, (13) Cotizar. Recibe <em>simbolos</em> separados por comas (máximo 5) y devuelve <em>precios</em>: lista JSON con simbolo, nombre, precio, cierre_anterior, moneda, hora y error.</p>",
                "isFilterNote": false,
                "metadata": {
                    "color": "#9138FE"
                }
            }
        ]
    }
}
